<p>Thank you for your interest in using the TPI Centre's Management Quality (MQ) data. MQ assessments for 10,000 companies are updated annually on the TPI Centre website.</p>

<p>Please <a href="<%= @download_url %>">click here</a> to download the MQ assessment data for a subset of 2,000 focus companies, which have been selected based on market capitalisation and emissions [see <a href="https://www.transitionpathwayinitiative.org/faqs">FAQs</a>]. This link will expire in 7 days.</p>

<p>The additional data as visible on the website are available without Authorisation or License directly from TPI's Data Partner, LSEG. More frequently updated MQ assessments are also available from LSEG, but they are subject to licensing. To discuss further, please reach out to <a href="mailto:tpimqaccess@lseg.com">tpimqaccess@lseg.com</a>.</p>

<p>The TPI Centre's data are governed by the <a href="https://www.transitionpathwayinitiative.org/use-of-the-centre-s-data">Terms of Use</a>. LSE reserves the right to review requests and in the event of a suspected breach of these terms of use may conduct an investigation and take subsequent action to ensure compliance, or authorise its data partners and/or other third parties to do so on its behalf.</p>
